# ==============================================================================
# DSL Stationery E-Commerce Platform — Root Environment Example Guide
# ==============================================================================
# The DSL Stationery platform is composed of two independent applications:
# 1. Frontend: Next.js 16 (Turbopack) web store and admin portal
# 2. Backend:  NestJS 11 + Prisma 7 + PostgreSQL 18 API
#
# Please configure environment variables in each respective directory:
# - Frontend: copy 'frontend/.env.example' to 'frontend/.env'
# - Backend:  copy 'backend/.env.example' to 'backend/.env'
#
# For detailed computer transfer instructions, see:
# - docs/SETUP/DSL_ENVIRONMENT_AND_CREDENTIALS_REPORT.md
# - docs/SETUP/DSL_SECOND_COMPUTER_SETUP_GUIDE.md
# - docs/SETUP/DSL_ENVIRONMENT_HANDOVER_CHECKLIST.md
